## 1. Operator Reference & Quick-Start

### Operational Intent
GPI processes staged person entity fragments (`data/entities/pep-let-*.json`) into the master registry (`data/entities/people.json`). It enforces schema validation, verifies graph traversal to root ancestor `IND-00000`, mints sequential IDs, injects reciprocal kinship links via `KinshipEngine`, commits atomically through `GDAPeople`, and cleans staging workspaces.

